    <panel_attributes>*Facade pattern*
Facade: FridgemateFacade
Clients: the 10 FastAPI routers
Subsystem: services, agents and CommandHistory
Every method takes a RequestContext, so every
call is limited to the member's own household.
bg=#FFFFE0</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1460</x>
      <y>520</y>
      <w>350</w>
      <h>100</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Every page calls ApiClient, and both clients
send each request with the member's Auth0
token. Every router checks that token with
TokenVerifier (one dependency is drawn to
keep the diagram readable).
bg=#FFFFE0</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
